  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.OASISBootLoader v2.0.7\n\nThe OASIS BootLoader provides a single entry point to initialise the entire OASIS ecosystem in any .NET application. Reads OASISDNA configuration, registers and activates all configured providers, sets up Auto-FailOver/LoadBalancing, and returns a ready-to-use OASIS instance. Integrate 55+ decentralised networks into your app with just a few lines of code. Part of the OASIS Omniverse at https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.6\n- Add checked encrypted record history to V2 EVM providers (aa48e66)\n- Add explicit public S3 metadata CQL source and recover Oracle query adapter (64c0d94)\n- Bind Ethereum history through existing DNA registration (aa5173d)\n- Enforce explicit Cosmos signed fee ceilings and wire DNA configuration (7fa8956)\n- feat(aws): add encrypted S3 provider over shared SDK transport (c666a82)\n- feat(cosmos): wire reviewed escrow settings and verify stored-wallet release (a82c668)\n- feat(hedera): configure explicit escrow protocol through OASISDNA (f867b5f)\n- feat(hedera): wire explicit prepared query policy from OASISDNA (de8fff4)\n- feat(solid): preserve encrypted history and conditional lifecycle integrity (2578d22)\n- feat(sui): wire explicit deposit registry through OASISDNA (ebfc83f)\n- feat(tron): configure id-bound custody and verify encrypted wallet release (c6aa3b7)\n- Fix Avalanche encryption chain identity and verify CQL Mongo demo MVP (6a52956)\n- Fix Rootstock V2 query authority and configured chain factory ownership (a69578d)\n- fix(aws): reject whitespace S3 session credentials before SDK use (a41eb72)\n- Implement conditional Azure Blob record history across public storage APIs (da6640e)\n- Implement conditional DynamoDB and AWS record history with native verification (dfabb90)\n- Implement Neo4j COSMIC transactions, role ownership and native registration (d7a75ab)\n- Integrate encrypted OCI OASIS provider with isolated namespaces and configuration (6689b80)\n- Integrate Oracle shared record history with native race and corruption proof (2e024de)\n- Integrate verified native BNB BootLoader registration (c6bcd75)\n- Integrate verified Polkadot activation and zkPass attestation verification (3799646)\n- Integrate verified TRON native BootLoader activation (2e26350)\n- Isolate the verified SQL Server BootLoader binding for Development (35940c2)\n- Keep admitted host boot passive without system-account storage calls (a70c5a3)\n- MOVING DOCS AROUND (32a8004)\n- Native data import API, Mongo native database setting, and sandbox demo shop data (2bc6b78)\n- Native import: allow-private-addresses is a DNA setting (OASIS.NativeImport.AllowPrivateAddresses); pin Core and STAR ODK (05eba7d)\n- Native import: Azure Cosmos, SOLID, ActivityPub, IPFS and Solana readers; STAR CLI nativeimport and cql commands; docs (fc85a95)\n- Native import: SQLite and Neo4j readers, saved mappings API, sandbox demo data for all three stores (83daa69)\n- Native import: the other five readers take a caller connection; stateless readers for connections; guarded HTTP handler; pin Core and STAR ODK (29dcbf9)\n- Prepare explicit SOLID membership and cancellable read-only source activation (9add191)\n- Prepare retained native IPFS demo source and explicit read-only query activation (131fd48)\n- Preserve BootLoader startup and registration errors (66a45c0)\n- Preserve Firestore history with native conditional record writes (771c313)\n- Qualify LocalFile storage directory on Development (e0ac96f)\n- Reject incomplete passive provider registration before admitted readiness (bed15d5)\n- Sandbox and native import: every setting comes from DNA (OASIS.Sandbox, OASIS.NativeImport); no hard-coded limits or environment variables; pin Core and STAR ODK (203c4f9)\n- Ship scoped hosted CQL source discovery and ActivityPub query examples (0f4ee31)\n- Unify Ethereum V2 with shared EVM storage and bind canonical conformance (c4938ee)\n- Verify bounded SOLID multi-record CQL and Mongo demo federation (a8b0d3e)\n- Verify encrypted SOLID multi-record CQL on retained private Pod (6c7a24b)\n- WEB4 API v5.3.0: OASISAPIVersion, release history, release test and docs (9d3c7ce)\n- WEB4 runtime 5.3.0; web4_version_sync.py + CI check + WEB4_VERSIONING.md keep API/runtime/docs/Postman in sync (a88cce5)\n- Wire ActivityPub native query profile into host registration (9e7e3eb)\n- Wire Cosmos record history option through OASISDNA registration (8602679)\n- Wire explicit Sui gas budget ceilings through DNA and BootLoader (b0bb60e)\n- Wire Oracle DNA configuration into provider registration (92b190f)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/OASIS Architecture/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.OASISBootLoader",
